title: PostgreSQL COPY TO/FROM PROGRAM RCE
id: ce1af83d-b2b7-41eb-baf4-4c9b042b5288
status: experimental
description: Detects PostgreSQL COPY ... TO/FROM PROGRAM, which executes an OS command via the database server, a well-known remote code execution technique against exposed or injected Postgres.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/
logsource:
  category: application
  product: postgresql
detection:
  selection:
    query_text|contains:
      - 'COPY '
      - 'PROGRAM'
    query_text|contains:
      - 'FROM PROGRAM'
      - 'TO PROGRAM'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query_text
  - user_name
  - client_ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate ETL using COPY PROGRAM
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.execution
  - attack.t1059
